## Original Content
В Евросоюзе в июле цены на автомобильное топливо и масла для личного транспорта выросли на 16,9% к июлю 2025 года, по данным Eurostat.

## Summary
In July, the European Union saw a 16.9% year-over-year increase in automobile fuel prices, according to Eurostat. This significant rise reflects the ongoing volatility in global energy markets. The data highlights the impact of external factors on EU's fuel prices.

## Key Points
- 16.9% YoY increase in EU automobile fuel prices in July
- Data sourced from Eurostat
- Reflects global energy market volatility


